  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.0.0 (breaking, shared version with EfCore.BaseRepositoryPack): targets .NET 8, 9 and 10 with patched EF Core versions. New ExecuteQueryInterpolatedAsync sends interpolated values as SQL parameters; the unparameterized ExecuteQueryAsync(string) is removed. The public _dbContext members of the repositories, Table and UnitOfWork are removed (use Table or GetTable()), as is ParameterValidationAttribute. Includes every fix since 1.3.0: shared context for one-by-one registrations, all-or-nothing list inserts, composite key updates, ordered pagination, nullable annotations.",
